      "mergeID": "66a3afa7ed34033028c4954b",
      "mergedPostDetails": "On the open beta, avatars with previously functioning finger joint setups now have fingers bent sideways when the hand is open and when fully closed, finger tips (claws, etc) push through the palm due to over extension of the joints.\n\nBackwards compatibility with existing avatar hand configurations need to be maintained.\n\nAffects multiple avatars but can be easily seen with: https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_695a0203-dbeb-49ee-832b-16f55002a229",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Fingers over-curl when using new tracking with Index controllers.",
